// One quality lens of the emotion detection case study, argued on its own.
//
// Note the two evidence labels. They are worded exactly as they are in graceful.jd, and
// that is not a coincidence: a label is the contract between bricks. Two bricks that word
// the same artifact the same way meet as one node when they are assembled.

justification performant {

    conclusion claim is "The classifier is performant"
    strategy   bar   is "The accuracy clears the 80% bar"

    evidence test  is "The test dataset is trustworthy"
    evidence model is "The trained model is available"

    bar   supports claim
    test  supports bar
    model supports bar

}
